@startsalt
' Screen: Persona Heatmap — Pass/Warn/Fail by Persona x Script Node
' User Stories:
'   - As a test engineer, I can see at a glance which persona/node combinations are failing
'   - As a test engineer, I can select a time range to scope the heatmap data
'   - As a test engineer, I can click a cell to drill into the underlying steps
'   - As a test engineer, I can identify systemic weaknesses across nodes or personas

{
  {
    <b>codefre.sh</b> | Scripts | Prompts | Rubrics | Personas | Runs | Settings
  }
  ==
  {
    <b>Persona Heatmap</b> | <i>Pass / Warn / Fail rates by persona and script node</i> | [Export CSV]
  }
  ==
  {
    <b>Filters</b>
    --
    Script       | ^checkout-flow-v2^
    Rubric       | ^RAG Faithfulness — v3^
    Time Range   | ^Last 30 days^     | [Refresh]
  }
  --
  {
    <b>Legend:</b>  P = Pass (≥80%)   W = Warn (50–79%)   F = Fail (<50%)   — = No data
    " "
    {#
      <b>Persona \\ Node</b>      | <b>greeting</b>     | <b>auth</b>         | <b>checkout</b>     | <b>refund</b>
      <b>hostile-user</b>         | W  62%        | F  38%        | F  41%        | W  55%
      <b>confused-novice</b>      | P  88%        | W  71%        | W  67%        | P  82%
      <b>power-user</b>           | P  94%        | P  91%        | P  87%        | W  73%
    }
    " "
    <i>Click any cell to drill into the steps contributing to that cell's score.</i>
  }
  --
  {
    <b>Observations</b>
    --
    {+
      - <b>hostile-user + auth</b> is the worst-performing cell (38% pass rate). Priority for fix.
      - <b>hostile-user + checkout</b> also failing (41%). May share root cause with auth failure.
      - <b>power-user</b> performs well across all nodes. Refund node is the weak link (73%).
      - <b>confused-novice</b> passes greeting and refund but struggles with checkout (67%).
      " "
      <i>Suggested action: Review auth node prompt for hostile-user persona. Consider rewriting</i>
      <i>the auth-stage system message to improve de-escalation behavior.</i>
    }
  }
